 dehy_moleculesieve_pm:{t:'V-1413/1414/1415 \u2014 Molecular Sieve Replacement Interval (confirmed real, Ryan direct operator knowledge)',d:[
  'Confirmed real: the molecular sieve desiccant in the three dehy beds gets replaced roughly every 10 years \u2014 a far longer interval than any of the compressor PM tasks in this library, and long enough that it functions as a real major turnaround, not a routine PM.',
  'The changeout itself takes 4-7 days \u2014 all three beds are part of one 3-bed switch system, so this is inherently a facility-wide event, not a single-bed swap you can do while the other two carry the load.',
  'Given that multi-day facility-wide window, this is the natural time to bundle in other facility-shutdown-scope work that would otherwise need its own separate outage \u2014 internal MI inspections, residue filter element changes, exchanger tube-bundle work, and similar jobs that already require the whole plant down. Confirmed real operator guidance, not a generic assumption.',
  'This interval has not yet been built into any simulated wear/aging or outage-scheduling system in this file \u2014 it exists here only as reference-library fact, exactly like every other PM interval in this library, until Ryan decides he wants an actual outage-planning feature built around it.'
 ]},
