 f518:{t:'518-10\u2033 demeth bottoms \u2192 V-1422',d:['TIED IN: T-1521 bottoms (via LV-1521) \u2192 surge tank','UNVERIFIED OVERLAP, FLAGGED NOT CORRECTED: the P\u0026ID M2150 detail pass (see xv1521/line518 entries under Demethanizer \u0026 Reboilers) separately documents an instrumented XV-1521 ESD valve on this same line, with its own ZSO/ZSC-1521 position feedback. LV-1521 here already has its own real, distinct XSY-1521 trip solenoid (see the lv/lt entries) \u2014 these read as two genuinely different valves (a modulating level-control valve plus a separate emergency shutdown valve in series), which is a completely normal P\u0026ID pattern, but this has NOT been field-verified against the real P\u0026ID side by side. Flagging rather than guessing \u2014 confirm with Ryan whether LV-1521 and XV-1521 are both real and distinct, or whether one source used an inconsistent tag for the same physical valve.']},
