  nmCard12NM(h,'1 / Cold feeds and warming overhead','RSV uses E-1221 then E-1222 before upper-feed letdown. GSP uses a different E-1222 passage. Tower overhead goes the opposite equipment order: E-1222 -> E-1221 -> C-1121, normally remaining vapor.');
  nmCard12NM(h,'2 / What happens at a bubble cap','Vapor rises through the hollow riser, turns under the cap, exits submerged slots and disperses in liquid. Condensation/absorption can transfer heavier components into liquid while vaporization/desorption transfers lighter material into vapor. Heat and component transfer occur together.');
